    "regime_notes": "Full-sample daily Spearman IC passes benchmark gates, but recent 180-day IC/ICIR weakened to 0.009949/0.03343; recent 360-day IC/ICIR was 0.026717/0.087386. Use conservative ensemble weight and monitor drift. Small cross-section is handled with an eight-name minimum.",
